<title>USA: Lark Technologies Inc Q1 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Lark Technologies Inc Q1 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.04		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net			    149			220</p>
<p> Revs			 1,110		    1,207</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 3,346		    2,145</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said its net income for the first quarter of 1997 included increased research and development expenditures of $62,685, an increase of 79 percent over the same period in 1996.</p>
